    "scopeShape": "A claim locks paths and/or explicit line regions. Overlap is structural: a directory claim locks every file beneath it, and a region inside an already-claimed file is covered.",
    "transferRule": "Ownership changes only by explicit release or handoff. Winning a technical argument does not transfer it; the current owner may implement another AI's accepted proposal.",
    "conflictRule": "A conflict naming contestedScope freezes only that scope. A conflict naming no scope, or marked repositoryWide, stops everything - the safe reading when the record does not say what is disputed.",
