    "provenanceRule": "Every response is kept separately with provider, model, timestamp, taskId, prompt hash and response hash. Responses are never merged into one authorless answer.",
    "failureRule": "A provider that could not be reached is recorded as failed, never dropped, and lowers corroboration to insufficient-evidence. An unreachable provider is unknown, not agreeing.",
    "authorityRule": "Cross-model agreement is evidence, not proof. No AI may declare its own work approved, and no AI may be the only reviewer of its own material change. Tests, security, governance, integrity checks and OWNER authority all outrank model consensus."
